# Authored skills under skills/ are tracked (the repo is their source of truth).
# Vendored third-party skills are not bundled here — install them via marketplace.
.DS_Store

.claude/
/speckit
akios/.local/

# akios/Vision.md, akios/Roadmap.md, akios/Context.md, akios/specs/, akios/tasks/ are NOT
# ignored: this repo dogfoods its own kit on itself (see akios/Context.md "What this repo is"),
# so these are the real, current project state, not template output — tracked like any other
# source file, same as in a consumer repo (akios-footprint-consolidation.md §7: only
# akios/.local/ is ever gitignored; the rest of akios/ is committed work product).
